<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="_Toc235450409" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 3 — Table with no header row</title>
   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d743e7">
         <p>Consider a table where the author has not used <codeph>&lt;th&gt;</codeph> elements for the first row — all rows use <codeph>&lt;td&gt;</codeph> elements only.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Table with no header row</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_hky_t14_lkc">
&lt;table>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>server-01&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>192.168.1.10&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Active&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>server-02&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>192.168.1.11&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Standby&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
  &lt;tr>
    &lt;td>server-03&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>192.168.1.12&lt;/td>
    &lt;td>Active&lt;/td>
  &lt;/tr>
&lt;/table></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock id="codeblock_jfd_t14_lkc">
&lt;reference id="api_parameters">
  &lt;title>API Parameters&lt;/title>
  &lt;refbody>
    &lt;simpletable frame="all" relcolwidth="1* 1* 1*" id="simpletable_yj1_ggk_rjc">
      &lt;sthead>
        &lt;stentry>server-01&lt;/stentry>
        &lt;stentry>192.168.1.10&lt;/stentry>
        &lt;stentry>Active&lt;/stentry>
      &lt;/sthead>
      &lt;strow>
        &lt;stentry>server-02&lt;/stentry>
        &lt;stentry>192.168.1.11&lt;/stentry>
        &lt;stentry>Standby&lt;/stentry>
      &lt;/strow>
      &lt;strow>
        &lt;stentry>server-03&lt;/stentry>
        &lt;stentry>192.168.1.12&lt;/stentry>
        &lt;stentry>Active&lt;/stentry>
      &lt;/strow>
    &lt;/simpletable>
  &lt;/refbody>
&lt;/reference></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>
            <b>Result:</b> The converter assumes that every HTML table requires a header row in the DITA output. When no <codeph>&lt;th&gt;</codeph> elements are present, the converter promotes the first <codeph>&lt;tr&gt;</codeph> of <codeph>&lt;td&gt;</codeph> elements into <codeph>&lt;sthead&gt;</codeph>. Always include a descriptive header row using <codeph>&lt;th&gt;</codeph> elements in HTML tables.</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>